## 9. MCP Server ke saath Relationship

`CircuitService` khud MCP tool nahi hai.

Ye **business logic layer** hai.

MCP server is service ke functions ko tools ke through expose karta hai.

Architecture:

```text
AI / MCP Client
       │
       ▼
   MCP Server
       │
       ├── add_gate
       ├── remove_gate
       ├── clear_circuit
       ├── delete_circuit
       └── get_circuit
              │
              ▼
       CircuitService
              │
              ▼
        Circuit Map
```

Example:

```text
AI requests:
"Add H gate on qubit 0"

        ↓

MCP add_gate tool

        ↓

circuitService.addGate()

        ↓

circuit.gates.push()

        ↓

Updated circuit returned
```

---

## 10. Why This Service Layer Is Used

Circuit operations ko directly MCP tool handlers me likhne ke bajay `CircuitService` me rakhne ka advantage ye hai ki **circuit-related logic ek centralized place par maintain hota hai**.

Isse:

* MCP tools simple rehte hain
* Code reusable hota hai
* Circuit logic easily test kiya ja sakta hai
* Future me database add karna easier hota hai
* Frontend/backend integration ke time same service logic reuse kiya ja sakta hai

---

## 11. Current Limitations

Current implementation intentionally simple hai.

### In-memory storage

```js
new Map()
```

use hone ki wajah se server restart hone par circuits lost ho jate hain.

### No persistent database

Currently MongoDB/PostgreSQL jaisa database use nahi ho raha.

### Basic validation

Qubit validation available hai, lekin advanced circuit validation abhi implement nahi ki gayi hai.

### No quantum execution

`CircuitService` ka current purpose **circuit manipulation** hai, quantum circuit simulation ya measurement nahi.

---

## 12. Summary

`circuitService.js` MCP server ke liye quantum circuit management layer provide karta hai.

Its main operations are:

```text
createCircuit()
      ↓
addGate()
      ↓
getCircuit()
      ↓
removeGate()
      ↓
clearCircuit()
      ↓
deleteCircuit()
```

In functions ki help se MCP server AI/MCP clients ko quantum circuit ko modify aur inspect karne ki capabilities provide karta hai.
